;; The width-one star atlas.
;;
;; One entry per canonical star family under the full cubical
;; group; luft/star-table.lisp unfolds these local patches onto
;; all 256 stars.  Coordinates are integer mesh ticks local to
;; the lattice site; faces are keyed by cell sample pairs, bands
;; by signed axis directions.  Regenerate with
;; (luft::write-star-atlas); LUFT's tests pin every unfolded star
;; to the star-geometry derivation.
